---
description: No circular imports in zhoda_core; type-only deps use TYPE_CHECKING
globs: core/**/*.py
alwaysApply: false
---

# Imports

Runtime cycle `factions.py` ↔ `judges.py` breaks `zhoda` on startup
(`ImportError: cannot import name 'Faction' from partially initialized module`).

- Type-only dependencies: `from __future__ import annotations` +
  `if TYPE_CHECKING:`.
- `judges` must not import `Faction` at runtime; `factions` must not import
  `Judges` at runtime.
- After touching import graph: `from zhoda_core.cli import app` must succeed.
  Covered by `tests/test_imports.py`.
